-+-------+---------+We model the four landmasses as vertices 0–3 of a multigraph:
-+-------+---------+- Vertex 0: Central island (Kneiphof)
-+-------+---------+- Vertex 1: Northern bank
-+-------+---------+- Vertex 2: Southern bank
-+-------+---------+- Vertex 3: Eastern island (Lomse)
