--+-------------+* `konigsberg_no_eulerian_trail` — The Königsberg graph has no Eulerian trail.
--+-------------+* `odd_degree_obstruction` — A graph with more than 2 odd-degree vertices
--+-------------+  has no Eulerian trail (from Mathlib).
