--+-------+-+----+- Edge 4: One bridge from vertex 0 to vertex 3
--+-------+-+----+- Edge 5: One bridge from vertex 1 to vertex 3
--+-------+-+----+- Edge 6: One bridge from vertex 2 to vertex 3
