-+----++ +--+* `Bridges.konigsberg_odd_count` : All four vertices have odd degree.
-+----++ +--+* `Bridges.konigsberg_no_eulerian_trail` : There is no Eulerian trail in the Königsberg graph.
-+----++-+--+-/
-+----++-+--+
