+--+--+-----**The Königsberg Bridge Theorem**: There is no Eulerian trail in the
+--+--+-----Königsberg graph. This formalizes Euler's 1736 result — one cannot walk
+--+--+-----through Königsberg crossing each bridge exactly once.
